    },
    "Governor status": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "调节器状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hard allowlist. The governor, per-app rules, and even an explicit \"Throttle [app]\" click will all refuse to touch processes whose names match. Use for anything where SIGSTOP would be catastrophic — backup tools, audio I/O, the foreground call you're on right now.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "硬性白名单。调节器、应用规则，甚至直接点击\"限制 [应用]\"都不会影响名称匹配的进程。适用于任何 SIGSTOP 会造成灾难性后果的场景——备份工具、音频 I/O、你正在进行的通话等。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Header (Air Assist + pause menu) and the Dashboard / Preferences / Quit actions are always visible — they're how you reach this pane.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "标题栏（Air Assist + 暂停菜单）和仪表盘 / 偏好设置 / 退出操作始终可见——这是你访问此面板的入口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
