          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How often Air Assist polls IOKit sensors. 1s gives the most responsive menu bar, 5-10s is gentler on battery. The thermal governor's control loop ticks at this rate too, so longer intervals make throttling decisions slower.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Air Assist 轮询 IOKit 传感器的频率。1 秒可获得最灵敏的菜单栏响应，5-10 秒更省电。热调节器的控制循环也以此频率运行，较长的间隔会使限制决策变慢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
