    "Limit CPU to…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "限制 CPU 至…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "List of processes you've manually thrown a cap on, with their remaining time. Always hidden when nothing's manually throttled, so most of the time leaving this on is invisible.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "手动限制的进程列表及剩余时间。无活跃手动限制时始终隐藏，开启后多数时间不显示内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Live list of the top processes by CPU usage right now. Click any one to instantly cap it at your default throttle duty (configured in Frontmost-app quick throttle above). Apps already covered by a rule show their current cap; protected apps show as such.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "当前 CPU 使用率最高的进程实时列表。点击任一进程即可将其限制到默认限制负载（在上方\"前台应用快速限制\"中配置）。已有规则的应用显示其当前上限；受保护的应用显示相应状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manual": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "手动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Manual override for the popover's \"Throttle [app]\" button. Hits whatever app is currently in the front (Safari, Xcode, whatever you can see), with a fixed duty and duration you set here. Useful for one-off cooling without writing a permanent rule.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "弹窗中\"限制 [应用]\"按钮的手动覆盖。针对当前最前端的应用（Safari、Xcode，你能看到的任何应用），使用你在此设置的固定负载和持续时间。适用于一次性降温而无需编写永久规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
