    "On battery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "使用电池时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once a day, Air Assist asks api.github.com for the latest release tag. No telemetry, no user data — just the version number. Off by default for users who prefer to control when network calls happen.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "每天一次，Air Assist 向 api.github.com 查询最新版本标签。不上报数据，不收集用户信息——仅检查版本号。默认关闭，适合希望掌控网络请求时机的用户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One daily request to api.github.com to see if a newer release exists. No telemetry, no personal data — just the version tag. Turning this off leaves the \"Check for Updates…\" menu item working for manual checks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "每天向 api.github.com 发送一次请求以检查是否有新版本。不含任何遥测数据、不含个人信息——仅查询版本标签。关闭此选项后，\"检查更新…\"菜单项仍可手动使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only act while on battery; armed-but-silent on AC.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "仅在使用电池时生效；接通电源时待命但不干预。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only on battery": {
