          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Paused · resumes %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "已暂停 · %@ 后恢复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Per-app rules": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "各应用规则"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Per-core sum": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "各核心总和"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Percent of CPU time the app is allowed — 5 to 100.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "应用被允许的 CPU 时间百分比——5 到 100。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Performance": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "性能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persistent caps on specific apps regardless of temperature. The governor leaves rule-covered PIDs alone (no double-throttling). Rules engage whenever a matching process spends sustained time above 5% CPU, and release automatically when the app idles. Re-applies on relaunch — survives quit/reopen of either app.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "针对特定应用的持久上限，不受温度影响。调节器不会触碰已有规则覆盖的 PID（无双重限制）。当匹配进程的 CPU 持续超过 5% 时规则生效，应用空闲时自动解除。重新启动后自动重新应用——不受应用退出和重新打开的影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick a threshold profile. You can fine-tune individual numbers in Preferences later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "选择一个阈值配置文件。之后可以在偏好设置中微调各项数值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick from running processes, or type an executable name. Names are matched exactly (case-sensitive).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "从运行中的进程中选择，或输入可执行文件名称。名称精确匹配（区分大小写）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pin %@ to top": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "置顶 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pin to top": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "置顶"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Please restart Air Assist for the language change to take effect.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "请重新启动 Air Assist 以使语言更改生效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Popover": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "弹窗"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Posts a system notification the first time the governor breaches a cap after a quiet period. Useful when Air Assist is hidden and you want to know the OS is being throttled. macOS asks for permission the first time you turn this on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "在调节器于静默期后首次突破上限时发送系统通知。适用于 Air Assist 隐藏时，你想了解系统正在被限制的情况。首次开启时 macOS 会请求通知权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Posts a system notification the first time the governor breaches a temperature or CPU cap after a quiet period. Rate-limited so a single sustained workload posts once, not dozens of times. macOS will ask for notification permission the first time you turn this on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "当调节器在静默期后首次触发温度或 CPU 上限时发送系统通知。采用频率限制，同一持续工作负载仅通知一次。首次开启此功能时 macOS 会请求通知权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preferences…": {
      "comment": "Menu bar item: opens Preferences",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "偏好设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prefix the value with a one-letter category badge (C CPU, G GPU, S SoC, B battery, D disk) when a Highest slot is showing. Tells you at a glance which sensor won the 'hottest' race so 91° isn't ambiguous.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "当显示最高值位置时，在数值前添加一个字母类别标记（C CPU、G GPU、S SoC、B 电池、D 磁盘）。让你一眼看出哪个传感器最热，91° 不再模棱两可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Presenting": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "演示"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Preset:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "预设："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prevents both system and display sleep. Equivalent to caffeinate -id.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "阻止系统和屏幕休眠。相当于 caffeinate -id。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prevents both system and display sleep. Think of it as caffeinate with the screen locked on.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "防止系统和屏幕休眠。可理解为屏幕保持常亮的 caffeinate。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prevents idle sleep. Display follows its normal schedule. Equivalent to caffeinate -i.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "阻止空闲休眠。屏幕按照正常时间表运行。相当于 caffeinate -i。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Prevents idle sleep. The display can still turn off on its normal schedule — useful for downloads, renders, or long builds.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "防止空闲休眠。屏幕仍可按其正常计划关闭——适用于下载、渲染或长时间编译。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Process": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "进程"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Process runs this fraction of the time and is paused the rest. 30% means it gets ~30% of the CPU it would otherwise use.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "进程在此比例的时间内运行，其余时间暂停。30% 表示它大约能使用原本 CPU 时间的 30%。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protected": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "受保护"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Protected by Air Assist's safety list — won't be auto-throttled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "受 Air Assist 安全列表保护 — 不会被自动限速。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
