    "Set the warm/hot color bands per sensor category. These drive the menu bar tint, the popover color stripes, and the dashboard. They do NOT throttle anything — the governor uses its own ceiling in Throttling preferences. Different categories run at different normal temps (battery is much cooler than CPU), which is why each gets its own pair.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "按传感器类别设置温热/过热色带。这些色带驱动菜单栏色调、弹窗颜色条和仪表盘。它们不会限制任何东西——调节器使用限制偏好设置中自己的上限。不同类别有不同的正常工作温度（电池比 CPU 低得多），因此每个类别都有自己的阈值对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set to 25% (heavy)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "设为 25%（重度限制）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set to 50%": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "设为 50%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set to 85% (light)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "设为 85%（轻度限制）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Set up a per-app rule in one click. The rule re-applies whenever the app launches and matches by bundle ID, so it sticks across quits and relaunches.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "一键设置应用规则。规则在应用每次启动时基于 Bundle ID 重新生效，因此退出和重启后依然有效。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings for the popover's \"Throttle [app]\" button. The cap auto-releases after the chosen duration, or you can click the button again to release immediately.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "弹窗中“限制 [应用]”按钮的设置。到达所选时间后自动解除上限，也可以再次点击按钮立即解除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings for the popover’s “Throttle [app]” button. The cap auto-releases after the chosen duration, or you can click the button again to release immediately.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "弹窗“限制 [应用]”按钮的设置。限制在所选时长后自动释放，你也可以再次点击按钮立即释放。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
