      }
    },
    "Swap your sensor warm/hot color thresholds based on power source. AC stays cooler-feeling (you'd unplug if it got hot); battery stays useful longer (don't trip warnings on every modest workload). Governor caps and per-app rules are not affected.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "根据电源类型切换传感器温热/过热颜色阈值。接通电源时更保守（设备发热你会拔掉电源）；使用电池时更实用（不会在每个中等负载上都触发警告）。调节器上限和应用规则不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Swaps your sensor thresholds based on power source. Only the warm/hot color bands change — governor caps and per-app rules are untouched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "根据电源类型切换传感器阈值。仅变更温和/高温的颜色区间——调节器上限和各应用规则不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to a one-click setup (Presenting / Quiet / Performance / Auto). Bundles governor mode, caps, on-battery gating, and stay-awake.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "切换到一键式设置（演示 / 安静 / 性能 / 自动）。包含调节器模式、上限、电池触发和保持唤醒。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "系统"
          }
        }
      }
