            "value": "温度单位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporarily release every throttled process. Governor and per-app rules stop firing until resumed or the duration expires.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "临时释放所有被限制的进程。调节器和各应用规则停止触发，直到手动恢复或计时器到期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Temporarily stop both the governor and per-app rules. Useful for gaming or rendering sessions.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "临时停止调节器和各应用规则。适用于游戏或渲染场景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Mac follows its normal Energy Saver settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Mac 按照正常的节能设置运行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The block at the bottom with the governor toggle, scenario picker, stay-awake mode, and the on-battery-only switch. Hide if you only configure these from Preferences.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "底部控制区，包含调节器开关、场景选择器、保持唤醒模式和仅电池模式开关。如仅在偏好设置中配置可隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The governor watches sensors and total CPU% on a 1-second control loop. When a cap is breached, it picks the top N CPU processes (excluding ones covered by per-app rules and the never-throttle list) and applies a duty cycle to bring the readings back below cap minus hysteresis. It releases automatically when temps fall.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "调节器以 1 秒控制循环监控传感器和总 CPU 百分比。当超过上限时，它会选择前 N 个 CPU 进程（排除应用规则和永不限制列表中的进程），并应用占空比将读数带回上限减去滞后值以下。当温度降低时自动解除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The grid of sensor cards plus the live trend sparkline. Hide if you only want the popover for controls and don't need the at-a-glance temperature view.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "传感器卡片网格及实时趋势图。如仅需弹窗控制而不需要温度概览可隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The screen stays on for the configured minutes, then sleeps while background work continues. Great for presentations or long reads that eventually need to go idle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "屏幕在配置的分钟内保持开启，然后休眠，同时后台工作继续运行。适用于演示或最终需要息屏的长时间阅读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These aren't enabled automatically. Toggle any that you actually run.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "这些不会自动启用。请手动切换你实际使用的项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thin bar across the bottom of the menu bar item. Fills left-to-right and ramps blue → orange → red as the hottest visible sensor approaches its hot threshold. Gives you advance warning before the icon turns orange. Hidden when the Mac is cool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "菜单栏项底部的细条。当最热的可见传感器接近其过热阈值时，从左到右填充并逐渐从蓝色变为橙色再变为红色。在图标变橙之前提前预警。Mac 温度较低时隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app has a %lld%% CPU limit": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此应用的 CPU 限制为 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This app is in your Never-Throttle list. Remove it from there to enable rules.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "此应用在你的永不限制列表中。从列表中移除以启用规则。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This process is on Air Assist's protection list and can only be inspected, not throttled": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此进程在 Air Assist 的保护列表中，只能查看，无法限速"
          }
        }
      }
