    "Today": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "今天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle pause/resume from any app, even when Air Assist isn't focused. Built on Carbon's RegisterEventHotKey — no Accessibility permission required, and the shortcut is reserved system-wide so it works inside full-screen apps and games.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "从任何应用切换暂停/恢复，即使 Air Assist 未处于前台。基于 Carbon 的 RegisterEventHotKey——无需辅助功能权限，快捷键在系统范围内保留，因此在全屏应用和游戏中也能正常工作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Toggle pause/resume from any app. Carbon-based — no Accessibility permission required.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "从任何应用切换暂停/恢复。基于 Carbon——无需辅助功能权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Top 5 processes by CPU usage right now, with a right-click menu to throttle, rule, or protect. Hide if you'd rather rely on the dashboard for process visibility.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "当前 CPU 使用率前 5 的进程，右键菜单可限制、设置规则或保护。如偏好使用仪表盘查看进程可隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
