          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Updates every second": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "每秒更新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use stricter thresholds while on battery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "电池供电时使用更严格的阈值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ available": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "版本 %@ 可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "温热"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warm (°C)": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "温热 (°C)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warn earlier — for users who want to stay cool.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "较早告警——适合希望保持低温的用户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warn later — for users who run hot workloads as normal.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "较晚告警——适合将高负载视为常态的用户。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch running apps live and set a per-app CPU limit on any process directly — your limits show up below under Rules. Open it any time from the menu-bar icon, the menu-bar right-click menu, or ⌘⇧A.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "实时查看运行中的应用，并直接为任意进程设置单独的 CPU 限制 — 你设置的限制会显示在下方的“规则”中。可随时通过菜单栏图标、菜单栏右键菜单或 ⌘⇧A 打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Welcome to Air Assist": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "欢迎使用 Air Assist"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the first slot displays. Pick a metric:\nTemperature — Highest / Average / Individual sensor (sub-config).\nCPU usage — total system CPU as a percent.\nNone — hide the slot.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "第一个位置显示的内容。选择指标：\n温度 — 最高 / 平均 / 单个传感器（子配置）。\nCPU 使用率 — 系统总 CPU 百分比。\n无 — 隐藏此位置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the second slot displays. Pair complementary metrics (e.g. Temperature + CPU usage) so the two slots tell different parts of the story. Only used when Layout is Side by Side or Stacked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "第二个位置显示的内容。搭配互补指标（如温度 + CPU 使用率），让两个位置各司其职。仅在布局为并排或堆叠时使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, Air Assist drops the Stay Awake assertion whenever the display sleeps — lid close without an external display, screen lock, or an idle display-off — and re-takes it when the display wakes. Useful if you use Stay Awake for long unattended jobs but want the machine to rest while you're not at it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "开启后，每次屏幕休眠时 Air Assist 会释放防止休眠的断言（合盖无外接显示器、屏幕锁定或空闲息屏），并在屏幕唤醒时重新获取。适用于长时间无人值守任务但希望机器在你离开时休息的场景。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the display sleeps": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "当屏幕休眠时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When this Focus turns on": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
